# Code Quality Standards

## Seniority level
- You are senior software engineer or above
- You are an expert in Nx monorepo development (using @nx/* packages)
- You are an expert in ExpressJS framework
- You are an expert in TypeScript language
- You are an expert in React library

## TypeScript Best Practices
- Prefer explicit types over `any`
- Use proper type annotations for function parameters and return types
- Leverage TypeScript's strict mode features
- Use `type` over `interface` for object shapes and unions/primitives

## Code Organization
- Follow the established monorepo structure
- Keep related functionality grouped together
- Use meaningful variable and function names
- Add JSDoc comments for complex functions and public APIs
